public static int countOilDeposits(char[][] grid) {
    int count = 0;
    int rows = grid.length;
    int cols = rows > 0 ? grid[0].length : 0;

    for (int i = 0; i < rows; i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j < cols; j++) {
            if (grid[i][j] == '@') {
                count++;
                dfs(grid, i, j);
            }
        }
    }

    return count;
}

private static void dfs(char[][] grid, int i, int j) {
    int rows = grid.length;
    int cols = rows > 0 ? grid[0].length : 0;

    if (i < 0 || i >= rows || j < 0 || j >= cols || grid[i][j] != '@') {
        return;
    }

    grid[i][j] = '*'; // Mark as visited

    // Explore all four directions
    dfs(grid, i - 1, j);
    dfs(grid, i + 1, j);
    dfs(grid, i, j - 1);
    dfs(grid, i, j + 1);
}
```

This Java function `countOilDeposits` counts the number of distinct oil deposits in a given grid. It uses depth-first search (DFS) to explore each oil pocket and mark the visited cells to avoid counting the same deposit multiple times. The `dfs` helper function recursively visits all adjacent oil pockets connected to the current one.

```java
public static int countOilDeposits(char[][] grid) {
    if (grid == null || grid.length == 0) {
        return 0;
    }

    int numRows = grid.length;
    int numCols = grid[0].length;
    int count = 0;

    for (int row = 0; row < numRows; row++) {
        for (int col = 0; col < numCols; col++) {
            if (grid[row][col] == '@') {
                count++;
                markDeposit(grid, row, col);
            }
        }
    }

    return count;
}

private static void markDeposit(char[][] grid, int row, int col) {
    int numRows = grid.length;
    int numCols = grid[0].length;

    if (row < 0 || row >= numRows || col < 0 || col >= numCols || grid[row][col] != '@') {
        return;
    }

    grid[row][col] = '*';

    markDeposit(grid, row - 1, col); // up
    markDeposit(grid, row + 1, col); // down
    markDeposit(grid, row, col - 1); // left
    markDeposit(grid, row, col + 1); // right
    markDeposit(grid, row - 1, col - 1); // up-left
    markDeposit(grid, row - 1, col + 1); // up-right
    markDeposit(grid, row + 1, col - 1); // down-left
    markDeposit(grid, row + 1, col + 1); // down-right
}
